# SOC Automation Lab (Advanced)

This project demonstrates a full SOC automation pipeline using Wazuh, Shuffle SOAR, TheHive, Cortex, Sysmon, and VirusTotal.

## Lab Architecture

Sysmon → Wazuh → Shuffle → TheHive → Cortex → VirusTotal → Auto Response

## Tools Used

* Wazuh SIEM
* Shuffle SOAR
* TheHive
* Cortex
* Sysmon
* VirusTotal API
* Docker
* Python automation

## Automation Features

* Detect suspicious process via Sysmon
* Send alert to Wazuh
* Shuffle triggers workflow
* Create case in TheHive
* Cortex runs analyzer
* VirusTotal lookup
* Auto block malicious IP

## How to Run

docker-compose up -d

Configure API keys in config file

Run scripts in /scripts

